sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Lambda as ObservableOnSubscribe
    participant Emitter as CreateEmitter
    participant OO as ObserveOnObserver
    participant Q as SpscLinkedArrayQueue
    participant W as NewThreadWorker
    participant MapO as MapObserver
    participant You as Observer

    rect rgb(255, 236, 209)
        Note over Lambda,W: 上游线程  有 subscribeOn 则是 io
        Lambda->>Emitter: onNext(1)
        Emitter->>OO: onNext(1)
        OO->>Q: offer(1)
        OO->>W: schedule(this)
        Note over OO,W: 切线程：事件入队后交给 newThread drain
    end

    rect rgb(220, 245, 220)
        Note over W,You: newThread  出队 + map + 回调
        W->>OO: run / drainNormal
        OO->>Q: poll 得到 1
        OO->>MapO: onNext(1)
        MapO->>MapO: apply 得到 1
        MapO->>You: onNext String 1
    end
